config ADC_CSK6001
	bool "listenai CSK6001 embedded controller (EC) ADC driver"
	default y
	depends on HAS_CSK6001
	help
	  This option enables the ADC driver for CSK6001.
	  Say y if you wish to use ADC modules on CSK6001.